      "slug": "value-proposition",
      "excerpt": "Your value proposition should answer one question: Why should the customer choose you? A strong value proposition connects four things: Customer + Problem + Outcome + Differentiation. Not: “We provide high-qual",
      "content": "Your value proposition should answer one question:\n\nWhy should the customer choose you?\n\nA strong value proposition connects four things:\nCustomer + Problem + Outcome + Differentiation.\n\nNot:\n“We provide high-quality solutions.”\n\nBetter:\n“We help [customer] achieve [outcome] by solving [problem] differently through [advantage].”\n\nYour advantage could be speed, specialization, convenience, access, reliability, simplicity, technology, or customer experience.\n\nIf customers cannot quickly understand the value, the market will struggle to remember it.",
